# Committed, NON-SECRET build config for the production Vite build.
# Vite loads this in `npm run build` and inlines VITE_* vars into the client
# bundle — so ONLY put non-secret, client-safe values here.
#
# Real secrets (e.g. COMTRADE_KEY for the offline ingestion scripts) live in
# .env (gitignored) — never add them here.
#
# (No build vars needed at the moment.)
